    "Description": "A generalized two-brain monster AI library for pursuers, stalkers, predators, nemeses, bosses, and hostile agents. Deterministic cores consume plain snapshots and emit declarative pressure decisions and action requests; hosts remain responsible for entities, navigation, animation, combat, and replication. Optional Alien: Isolation-inspired compatibility preset; no game code or assets.",
